===Hosts and judges===
[[Tom Bergeron]] and [[Erin Andrews]] returned as hosts, while [[Carrie Ann Inaba]], [[Len Goodman]], [[Julianne Hough]], and [[Bruno Tonioli]] returned as judges.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://abc.go.com/shows/dancing-with-the-stars/about-the-show |title=About Dancing with the Stars |website=abc.go.com |access-date=March 1, 2017 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180316040627/http://abc.go.com/shows/dancing-with-the-stars/about-the-show |archive-date=March 16, 2018 |url-status=live }}</ref> On April 24, former contestant [[Nick Carter (musician)|Nick Carter]] joined the panel as a guest judge, filling in for Hough.<ref name="April24"/> On May 1, choreographer [[Mandy Moore (choreographer)|Mandy Moore]] also filled in for Hough as a guest judge.<ref name="May1"/>

=== Dance troupe ===
The troupe consisted of returning pros [[Alan Bersten]], Brittany Cherry, [[Hayley Erbert]], [[Britt Stewart]], and new pros Artur Adamski and [[Brandon Armstrong (dancer)|Brandon Armstrong]].

